  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Reducing Deforestation Driven by Cattle Expansion in Brazil</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">NWF&#x2019;s project is focused on addressing cattle expansion in Brazil which is a major driver of deforestation. They seek to specifically address &#x201C;the key impediments to deforestation free supply chains&#x201D; within this sector focusing both on changes that are required at the national level (government, ranchers, meat packers) as well as those changes that are required at the international level (European governments, International buyers, and investors).</narrative>
  </description>
